        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Extract the Claims Worth Checking\n\nPulls the factual claims out of a text, ignores opinions, and rates how checkable each claim is. Use it to triage before any verification work.\n\n**How it works:** \"Input\" takes the text. \"Agent\" lists each factual claim with its checkability (easy, hard or impossible) and where you would look to verify it. \"Output\" shows the list.\n\n**Try this:** Paste a news article or press release into \"Input\", pick a model on \"Agent\", and compare which claims it rates as easy against what you would check first."
        },
